    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23788" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δείς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δενός,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>no one</i> or <i>thing,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Alc.
				76
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>something,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὴ μᾶλλον τὸ δὲν ἢ τὸ μηδὲν
			εἶναι</span> (expld. as 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῶμα</span>
			, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κενόν</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Democr.
				156
			</span></i>. (Abstracted from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδείς.</span>)</div>
